  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Investing in gender statistics (Global and Asia-Pacific) 2016 - 2026</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Improving the quality, availability, accessibility and use of quality data and statistics for gender equality and women&apos;s and girls&apos; empowerment is crucial to progressing Australia&apos;s policy priority to advance gender equality. The gender data gap places a significant brake on international efforts to remove persistent and pervasive inequalities. A strengthened evidence base will assist policy makers and program managers implement programs that transform lives and ensure no one is left behind.</narrative>
  </description>
